  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://javalab.org/color/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://javalab.org/color/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"무슨 색으로 보일까? - 자바실험실\" data-og-description=\"빛의 삼원색 빨간색, 녹색, 파란색을 빛의 삼원색이라고 부르는데, 이 세가지 색의 빛을 적절히 조절하면 어떠한 색이라도 만들어 낼 수 있습니다. 빨간색 + 녹색 = 노란색 빨간색 + 파란색 = 자홍\" data-og-host=\"javalab.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://javalab.org/color/\" data-og-url=\"https://javalab.org/color/\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b3XaeF/hyUdZ7AYv7/ugJSXNOKiXKXtPMKK9d7IK/img.png?width=900&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_900_450,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bl2e15/hyUgUQ6mtQ/v3bwyvpi3GKBVukXyBGjyK/img.png?width=268&amp;height=256&amp;face=0_0_268_256\"><a href=\"https://javalab.org/color/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://javalab.org/color/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/b3XaeF/hyUdZ7AYv7/ugJSXNOKiXKXtPMKK9d7IK/img.png?width=900&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_900_450,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bl2e15/hyUgUQ6mtQ/v3bwyvpi3GKBVukXyBGjyK/img.png?width=268&amp;height=256&amp;face=0_0_268_256\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">무슨 색으로 보일까? - 자바실험실</p><p class=\"og-desc\">빛의 삼원색 빨간색, 녹색, 파란색을 빛의 삼원색이라고 부르는데, 이 세가지 색의 빛을 적절히 조절하면 어떠한 색이라도 만들어 낼 수 있습니다. 빨간색 + 녹색 = 노란색 빨간색 + 파란색 = 자홍</p><p class=\"og-host\">javalab.org</p></div></a></div><p>일단 자바실험실로 설명하고...(셀로판지는 생략)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>잘 이해했는지 확인하기 위해</p><p><a href=\"https://www.flippity.net/ra.php?k=15fTKJjf6TyrbyAsqdCjoxeQcHEeNU2rTIE1PygYezdI\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.flippity.net/ra.php?k=15fTKJjf6TyrbyAsqdCjoxeQcHEeNU2rTIE1PygYezdI</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"https://www.flippity.net/ra.php?k=15fTKJjf6TyrbyAsqdCjoxeQcHEeNU2rTIE1PygYezdI\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"www.flippity.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.flippity.net/ra.php?k=15fTKJjf6TyrbyAsqdCjoxeQcHEeNU2rTIE1PygYezdI\" data-og-url=\"https://www.flippity.net/ra.php?k=15fTKJjf6TyrbyAsqdCjoxeQcHEeNU2rTIE1PygYezdI\"><a href=\"https://www.flippity.net/ra.php?k=15fTKJjf6TyrbyAsqdCjoxeQcHEeNU2rTIE1PygYezdI\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.flippity.net/ra.php?k=15fTKJjf6TyrbyAsqdCjoxeQcHEeNU2rTIE1PygYezdI\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"null\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">https://www.flippity.net/ra.php?k=15fTKJjf6TyrbyAsqdCjoxeQcHEeNU2rTIE1PygYezdI</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">www.flippity.net</p></div></a></div><p>간단한 랜덤 퀴즈 돌려서 땡시험처럼 확인하려고 합니다~</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
